{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo features the first part of Escape from 8-Bit High.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hank, the leader of the band Blueberry Finn must gather the band and get ready for prom night.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile at Cloudydale High School, an ordinary Pomodore 64 becomes the stuff of 8-bit nightmares after being corrupted by a mysterious cassette\u2014one that unlocks malevolent intelligence and a thirst for domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967930/extras/817d4d539eaa42f7a39617b5bed2b9f6.poster.avif?t=1755877452\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967930/extras/817d4d539eaa42f7a39617b5bed2b9f6.gif?t=1755877452\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now supercharged and sentient, the Evil Commodore seizes control of an army of classic villains\u2014aliens, mole men, dinosaurs, and zombies\u2014bent on conquering Cloudydale... and then the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Blueberry Finn stands in its way. Hank, Duck and Alex, armed with their wits, instruments, and a serious grudge against evil hardware, the band is back to save the world\u2014again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967930/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.poster.avif?t=1755877452\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967930/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.webm?t=1755877452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967930/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.mp4?t=1755877452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Game will feature:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Tongue-in-cheek Humour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Elegant point 'n' click control of character, with &quot;Mouth&quot;, &quot;Hand&quot; and &quot;Eye&quot; interface inspired by classic of the genre like Full Throttle and The curse of Monkey Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Ideal for newcomers to the Adventure Game genre, familiar and nostalgic for veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Fight your battles to the last combo with Music, thanks to the Point and Click Music Battle System.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Different endings to discover based on your choices.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967930?t=1755877452","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967930?t=1755877452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967930/9592050381168995b6ebdd46670f2df18a95c078/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755877452","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967930/9592050381168995b6ebdd46670f2df18a95c078/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755877452","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo features the first part of Escape from 8-Bit High.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hank, the leader of the band Blueberry Finn must gather the band and get ready for prom night.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile at Cloudydale High School, an ordinary Pomodore 64 becomes the stuff of 8-bit nightmares after being corrupted by a mysterious cassette\u2014one that unlocks malevolent intelligence and a thirst for domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967930/extras/817d4d539eaa42f7a39617b5bed2b9f6.poster.avif?t=1755877452\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967930/extras/817d4d539eaa42f7a39617b5bed2b9f6.gif?t=1755877452\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now supercharged and sentient, the Evil Commodore seizes control of an army of classic villains\u2014aliens, mole men, dinosaurs, and zombies\u2014bent on conquering Cloudydale... and then the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Blueberry Finn stands in its way. Hank, Duck and Alex, armed with their wits, instruments, and a serious grudge against evil hardware, the band is back to save the world\u2014again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967930/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.poster.avif?t=1755877452\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967930/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.webm?t=1755877452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967930/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.mp4?t=1755877452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Game will feature:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Tongue-in-cheek Humour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Elegant point 'n' click control of character, with &quot;Mouth&quot;, &quot;Hand&quot; and &quot;Eye&quot; interface inspired by classic of the genre like Full Throttle and The curse of Monkey Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Ideal for newcomers to the Adventure Game genre, familiar and nostalgic for veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Fight your battles to the last combo with Music, thanks to the Point and Click Music Battle System.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Different endings to discover based on your choices.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Duck Made Of Wood"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2761220","name":"Escape from 8-Bit High"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967930/6c958aaa6875db6c55f01c601e007b9bc1739358/header.jpg?t=1755877452","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257185019,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185019/movie480.mp4?t=1755877450","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185019/movie_max.mp4?t=1755877450"},"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257185019/96858116724a636b9d003fe48c11dd43826a39a5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755877450","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185019/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755877450","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185019/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755877450"}}],"name":"Escape from 8-Bit High Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+), Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 with SSE2 <br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX